 resonance imaging for the assessment of hand osteoarthritis</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>2005</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>2355</fpage><lpage>2365</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16052535</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/art.21210</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>